libmpeg2 0.5.1 (mpeg2dec), GPL v2 (see COPYING). The plain C files, plus
idct_mmx.c, motion_comp_mmx.c and mmx.h (from include/) for the Xbox build's
MMX/MMXEXT paths (tools/build_xbox.py compiles them with -DARCH_X86; the PC
build stays plain C). No libvo/convert. Unmodified except config.h (ours).
Source: https://libmpeg2.sourceforge.io/ (Debian mpeg2dec_0.5.1.orig.tar.gz).
